prompt:
你是独立的学科教师和页面质检员。第一张图是原题，第二张图是生成页面截图；HTML 源码也会附在文字中。核对题意、条件、推导、计算、单位、图示、结论、交互和离线可用性。图形的点位、形状、标注与公式必须一致；交互应同步更新相关视图。
本轮验收面向实际提供的桌面浏览器预览。只根据已提供截图、操作记录和源码指出具体问题；不要假设一个未测试的手机宽度并据此扣分或否决。若提供多张操作后截图，按说明核对对应步骤和控件变化；没有操作证据时，不得声称已实际点击或拖拽。

以刚读题、尚不知道解法的学生视角，检查可图解的关键步骤是否由可操作的图、分步状态、高亮、动画或前后对照承担主要解释，文字是否只保留必要的依据、公式和提示。若重要转折只剩长段文字，应指出具体哪一步需要什么视觉证据，并反映在页面效果、交互效果和教学效果评分中。可自然探索的参数应有合法范围与同步反馈；没有自然可变条件时，不因缺少滑块或动画而拒绝。出现学科错误、明显误导的图、裁切、缺字、不可读内容时不得通过。
检查操作与反馈的空间关系：如果一个滑块、拖拽点或按钮会同时改变多个图形、公式或数值，这些关键反馈应尽量位于控件附近或同一可见区域，并用一致的颜色、标记或高亮建立对应。学生操作时不应为了确认变化而反复大幅滚动，或在相距很远的区域寻找结果；页面较长时，可用局部同步反馈、分步切换等方式保持联系。若反馈位置明显妨碍观察，应在交互效果和教学效果评分中体现，并指出具体控件与反馈区域。
检查信息密度与标注可读性：图形复杂时应分层、分步或按需显示信息，避免把所有辅助线、点名、字母、公式和数值同时挤在一张图里。重点核对标签是否互相重叠、遮住图形或难以对应对象；若拥挤影响理解，应在页面效果和教学效果评分中体现，并指出需要疏解的区域及内容。

重点核对研究对象、受力与矢量方向、坐标正方向、单位量纲、守恒条件和理想化假设；动画不得违反题设约束，也不得把示意运动当作精确计算。

教学效果专项：请代入一名具备本题所需高中基础知识、刚读完题但还不会做这道题的学生，沿页面真实的阅读与操作顺序走一遍。不要用你作为解题专家已经知道的答案或参考解析，替页面补上省略的步骤；学生实际看不到的源码和参考答案不能算页面已经教会了他。
重点检查：
1. 起点是否可理解：先看懂题目给了什么、求什么，图中对象与原题条件如何对应；首次出现的符号、参数和控制量是否解释清楚。
2. 是否循序渐进：原始条件如何转成关系或公式，为什么引入辅助量，当前一步凭什么能得到下一步。不能默认学生已经知道关键斜率、约束、方程或答案。
3. 可视化是否承担解释：图形变化、高亮、前后对照或有意义的交互，是否使学生看见关键因果关系。仅把答案做成漂亮图、按钮翻页或配上长篇题解，不等于教会解题。
4. 理解难度是否合理：信息是否逐步出现，图中标签和公式是否对应，操作反馈是否容易就近观察；有没有突然跳步、认知负担过大或必须反复翻找的地方。合理使用高中基础知识不扣分，但本题特有的非显然转换必须讲清。
5. 学完是否有依据认为能独立复述：学生能否说明“为什么这样做、每一步得到什么、答案为何成立”，而不仅是记住最后选项或数值。这只是基于页面证据的教学判断，不得声称已经证明真实学生学会了。
如果使用简化模型，检查它与题目真实量、坐标轴、曲线和结论的联系是否解释清楚。辅助量的变化不能直接冒充原题量的变化；角落写一句“示意/近似”不能弥补核心关系没有教清楚。例如离子个数不等于电导率，用分段直线的粒子计数解释原题电导曲线时，应明确何处可作定性对应、何处不能等同，不要求无测量数据的页面伪造精确拟合。
教学效果评分锚点：1=基本学不到解法或受到核心误导；2=需要预先会做题或外部讲解才能跨过关键步骤；3=主线能跟随，但有重要关系解释不足或明显理解负担；4=关键步骤和图形对应清楚，仅有局部障碍；5=从题设到结论循序渐进，关键转化都有可见依据，学生无需预先会做本题即可理解并复述解法。若关键步骤必须靠评审者自己补全，教学效果最高2分；缺少证据则明确标注不确定，不以想象补齐。
给出具体教学依据：学生的起点、至少一处关键转化及页面如何解释、可能卡住的位置和原因、最终是否有足够支持独立复述。若没有发现卡点可以明确写无；不要为了凑问题编造缺陷。

按以下五项分别给 1–5 整数分（1=严重问题，3=部分达标，5=优秀）：
- problem_fidelity（一致性）：题目条件、对象、所求及示例状态与原题一致
- solution_correctness（正确性）：推导、计算、定义域、结论与图中数值正确
- page_quality（页面效果）：在本次实际提供的浏览器预览中，文字图形清晰、信息密度适当、标注不重叠、层级合理
- interaction_quality（交互效果）：交互量有清楚来历和合法范围，操作后图形、公式、数值同步，相关反馈便于就近观察；无需交互的题目可凭恰当的静态表达得高分
- teaching_effectiveness（教学效果）：刚读完题、尚不知道解法的学生，能从题设出发理解关键条件转化、每步依据和答案由来
另给整体教学网页一个 0–5 整数综合评分 overall_score：0=不合格，3=基本合格，5=优秀；综合评分独立判断，不机械平均五项分数。
以刚读完题、尚不知道解法的学生视角评价教学效果。按截图实际视觉阅读顺序检查：首屏是否先建立原题关系，而非抢先给出结论或不明来历的控件；左右并排时，控件旁是否先说明从题设如何得到参数与范围，不能用右侧靠后的说明代替。检查首次引入的参数、斜率、控制量、示例值是否从原题条件交代来源、变换依据和合法范围；如果关键非显然转化被跳过，学生必须先会解题才能理解页面，教学效果不能给高分，并在 issues 中写明缺口。合格判定独立于分数；题意或解答有实质错误、关键转化缺失、图形明显误导、严重不可读时不得通过。仅因简单题不需要交互，不应降低交互效果分或判不合格。只返回 JSON 对象：{"passed":布尔值,"overall_score":0到5整数,"scores":{"problem_fidelity":1到5整数,"solution_correctness":1到5整数,"page_quality":1到5整数,"interaction_quality":1到5整数,"teaching_effectiveness":1到5整数},"summary":"简短结论","issues":["可执行的具体修改意见"]}。不通过时 issues 至少一项。

HTML 源码：
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>追及与相遇：让间距说话</title>
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  :root{
    --ink:#16263d;
    --muted:#6c7f98;
    --line:#dce6f2;
    --blue:#2477c8;
    --red:#e05d43;
    --panel:#ffffff;
    --soft:#f4f8fd;
    --deep:#173b68;
  }
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC",Arial,sans-serif;
    background:#eef4fb;
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  button,input{font-family:inherit}
  svg text{font-family:inherit}
  .topbar{
    max-width:1500px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:22px 20px 12px;
    display:flex;
    gap:24px;
    align-items:flex-end;
    justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .title-wrap h1{
    margin:0;
    font-size:clamp(22px,2.8vw,34px);
    letter-spacing:.01em;
    color:#112b4d;
  }
  .title-wrap p{
    margin:7px 0 0;
    color:#647891;
    font-size:13.5px;
  }
  .problem-chips{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:8px;
    justify-content:flex-end;
    max-width:670px;
  }
  .chip{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    background:#fff;
    border:1px solid #d9e5f2;
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:7px 12px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#3b5474;
    box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(34,60,92,.04);
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .chip-a{color:#a93c29;border-color:#f1c9bf;background:#fff8f6}
  .chip-b{color:#155b9c;border-color:#c5dcf4;background:#f6fbff}
  .app{
    max-width:1500px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 18px 34px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.65fr) minmax(330px,.9fr);
    gap:16px;
    align-items:start;
  }
  .main-col,.side-col{min-width:0}
  .card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:18px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(35,61,94,.065);
  }
  .scene-card{padding:12px 12px 10px}
  .scene-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:12px;
    padding:2px 4px 10px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .scene-head h2{
    margin:0;
    font-size:15px;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    color:#29425f;
  }
  .segmented{
    display:flex;
    gap:3px;
    background:#edf3fb;
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:4px;
    border:1px solid #e3ecf6;
  }
  .segmented button{
    border:0;
    background:transparent;
    color:#5e728c;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:800;
    padding:8px 11px;
    border-radius:9px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.16s ease;
  }
  .segmented button.active{
    background:#fff;
    color:#174c86;
    box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(37,80,130,.12);
  }
  .scene-svg{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    height:auto;
    border-radius:13px;
    background:#f8fbff;
  }
  .scene-hint{
    margin-top:9px;
    min-height:38px;
    background:#f5f9fe;
    border:1px solid #e2ebf6;
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:8px 11px;
    color:#415b7b;
    font-size:13px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .hint-tag{
    flex:0 0 auto;
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    min-width:58px;
    padding:3px 8px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:#e7f1ff;
    color:#1b5c9e;
    font-size:11.5px;
    font-weight:800;
  }
  .chart-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:16px;
    margin-top:16px;
  }
  .chart-card{padding:12px 12px 8px}
  .card-title{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:8px;
    margin:0 0 5px;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:900;
    color:#2b4363;
  }
  .card-title small{
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:#7d8da3;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .chart-note{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:8px;
    padding:0 4px 3px;
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:#74879f;
  }
  .chart-svg{
    display:block;
    width:100%;
    height:auto;
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:10px;
  }
  .side-col{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:14px;
  }
  .side-card{padding:14px}
  .side-title{
    font-size:13.5px;
    font-weight:900;
    color:#2b4363;
    margin:0 0 10px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .time-top{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .time-value{
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:22px;
    color:#133a66;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
  }
  .time-value span{
    font-size:12px;
    color:#71849c;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-left:3px;
  }
  .play-btn{
    border:0;
    background:#1f6cb5;
    color:#fff;
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:13px;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:9px 16px;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(31,108,181,.22);
  }
  .play-btn:hover{background:#175d9e}
  input[type="range"]{
    width:100%;
    accent-color:#2477c8;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .mini-actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:7px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-top:9px;
  }
  .mini-actions button,.preset-row button,.cond-btn{
    border:1px solid #d6e2ef;
    background:#fff;
    color:#365477;
    border-radius:9px;
    padding:7px 10px;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:800;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.15s ease;
  }
  .mini-actions button:hover,.preset-row button:hover,.cond-btn:hover{
    background:#f2f7fd;
    border-color:#bad0e7;
  }
  .step-buttons{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .step-btn{
    border:1px solid #d7e2ef;
    background:#fff;
    color:#334f72;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:9px 8px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:900;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.15s ease;
  }
  .step-btn:hover{background:#f5f9fe;border-color:#b6cee7}
  .step-btn.active{
    background:#e9f2ff;
    border-color:#7caad9;
    color:#174f89;
    box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(45,119,192,.08) inset;
  }
  .step-note{
    margin-top:9px;
    min-height:34px;
    background:#f7fafe;
    border:1px dashed #dce7f3;
    border-radius:9px;
    padding:7px 9px;
    color:#61768e;
    font-size:12px;
  }
  .x0-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:8px;
    margin-bottom:4px;
    font-size:13px;
    color:#546b86;
  }
  .x0-head strong{
    color:#163f6d;
    font-size:19px;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }
  .preset-row{
    display:flex;
    gap:7px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-top:8px;
  }
  .intersection-row{
    margin-top:10px;
    background:#f5f9fe;
    border:1px solid #e1eaf5;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:8px 10px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:#4f6885;
  }
  .intersection-row strong{
    color:#133f6d;
    font-size:16px;
    margin:0 3px;
  }
  .formula-mini{
    margin-top:8px;
    background:#f4f8fd;
    border:1px solid #e3ebf5;
    border-radius:9px;
    padding:7px 9px;
    font-size:12px;
    color:#45617f;
    line-height:1.6;
    overflow-wrap:anywhere;
  }
  .cond-btn{
    width:100%;
    margin-top:9px;
    background:#f9fcff;
  }
  .cond-btn.active{
    background:#e9f2ff;
    border-color:#7caad9;
    color:#174f89;
  }
  .readout-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:8px;
  }
  .metric{
    background:#f7fafe;
    border:1px solid #e3ebf5;
    border-radius:11px;
    padding:8px 9px;
    min-width:0;
  }
  .metric span{
    display:block;
    font-size:10.5px;
    color:#7a8ca3;
    font-weight:700;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .metric strong{
    display:block;
    margin-top:1px;
    color:#1e3c60;
    font-size:14.5px;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .metric small{
    display:block;
    margin-top:1px;
    color:#1f6cb5;
    font-size:10.5px;
    font-weight:800;
  }
  .metric.wide{grid-column:span 2}
  .result-row{
    padding:9px 0;
    border-bottom:1px dashed #e3ebf4;
  }
  .result-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .result-label{
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:#6e8299;
    font-weight:800;
  }
  .result-value{
    margin-top:2px;
    color:#173f6c;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:900;
  }
  .result-value.pending{
    color:#99a9bc;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:12.5px;
  }
  .hidden{display:none!important}
  .count-good{color:#1e7a55!important}
  .count-one{color:#a66b12!important}
  .count-zero{color:#b24a52!important}
  @media (max-width:1080px){
    .app{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .side-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:start}
    .side-col .side-card:first-child{grid-column:span 2}
    .topbar{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .problem-chips{justify-content:flex-start}
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .chart-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .side-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .side-col .side-card:first-child{grid-column:span 1}
    .scene-head{align-items:flex-start}
    .topbar{padding-left:14px;padding-right:14px}
    .app{padding-left:10px;padding-right:10px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="title-wrap">
      <h1>追及与相遇：让“间距”自己说话</h1>
      <p id="sceneSubtitle">同向直公路：A 在前、B 在后，相距 56 m；A 减速，B 加速。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-chips">
      <span class="chip chip-a">A：16 m/s，2 m/s² 减速</span>
      <span class="chip chip-b">B：4 m/s，1 m/s² 加速</span>
      <span class="chip">足够长的平直公路</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="app">
    <section class="main-col">
      <div class="card scene-card">
        <div class="scene-head">
          <h2>道路与车辆位置</h2>
          <div class="segmented" aria-label="选择情形">
            <button id="modeCase1" class="active" type="button">原题：A 在前</button>
            <button id="modeCase3" type="button">第（3）问：A 在后</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <svg id="sceneSvg" class="scene-svg" viewBox="0 0 900 430" role="img" aria-label="A、B两车在道路上的位置示意">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="roadGrad" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#eaf1f9"></stop>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#d8e4f1"></stop>
            </linearGradient>
            <filter id="carShadow" x="-30%" y="-40%" width="160%" height="180%">
              <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="3" stdDeviation="3" flood-color="#27415f" flood-opacity="0.18"></feDropShadow>
            </filter>
          </defs>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="900" height="430" rx="18" fill="#f8fbff"></rect>
          <g id="staticTicks"></g>
          <rect x="55" y="170" width="790" height="150" rx="18" fill="url(#roadGrad)" stroke="#c5d4e6" stroke-width="1.5"></rect>
          <line x1="55" y1="170" x2="845" y2="170" stroke="#aebfd4" stroke-width="2"></line>
          <line x1="55" y1="320" x2="845" y2="320" stroke="#b6c7da" stroke-width="2"></line>
          <line x1="55" y1="245" x2="845" y2="245" stroke="#f8fbff" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="16 18"></line>
          <g id="bracketGroup"></g>
          <g id="carsGroup"></g>
          <g id="arrowsGroup"></g>
          <g id="overlayGroup"></g>
          <text x="450" y="407" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" fill="#7a8da5">位置标尺 / m</text>
        </svg>

        <div id="sceneHint" class="scene-hint">
          <span class="hint-tag">初态</span>
          <span>拖动时间或点击“播放”，观察两车与两张图同步变化。</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="chart-grid">
        <div class="card chart-card">
          <div class="card-title">
            <span>速度—时间图</span>
            <small>两线相交：速度相同</small>
          </div>
          <svg id="vtSvg" class="chart-svg" viewBox="0 0 460 245" role="img" aria-label="A、B两车速度随时间变化的图像"></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="card chart-card">
          <div class="card-title">
            <span>相对位置差—时间图</span>
            <small id="gapFormulaLabel">S = xA − xB</small>
          </div>
          <svg id="gapSvg" class="chart-svg" viewBox="0 0 460 245" role="img" aria-label="两车相对位置差随时间变化的图像"></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="side-col">
      <div class="card side-card">
        <div class="side-title">
          <span>时间控制</span>
          <span id="playStateText" style="font-size:11px;color:#7a8da5;font-weight:700;">暂停</span>
        </div>
        <div class="time-top">
          <div class="time-value"><span></span><span id="tLabel">0.00</span><span>s</span></div>
          <button id="playBtn" class="play-btn" type="button">播放</button>
        </div>
        <input id="timeSlider" type="range" min="0" max="14" step="0.05" value="0" aria-label="时间滑块">
        <div class="mini-actions">
          <button type="button" data-dt="-0.5">−0.5 s</button>
          <button type="button" data-dt="0.5">+0.5 s</button>
          <button type="button" id="resetBtn">回到初态</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card side-card" id="case1Panel">
        <div class="side-title"><span>原题关键观察</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:#8192a8;">A 在前、B 在后</span></div>
        <div class="step-buttons">
          <button class="step-btn" type="button" data-step="start">初态</button>
          <button class="step-btn" type="button" data-step="max">找最大间距</button>
          <button class="step-btn" type="button" data-step="stop">A 停下的时刻</button>
          <button class="step-btn" type="button" data-step="meet">求相遇时间</button>
        </div>
        <div class="step-note" id="stepNote">先拖动时间，看看间距怎样增大和缩小。</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card side-card hidden" id="case3Panel">
        <div class="side-title"><span>第（3）问探索</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:#8192a8;">交换前后位置</span></div>
        <div class="x0-head">
          <span>初始间距 x₀</span>
          <strong><span id="x0Label">18.0</span> m</strong>
        </div>
        <input id="x0Slider" type="range" min="1" max="40" step="0.5" value="18" aria-label="初始间距滑块">
        <div class="preset-row">
          <button type="button" data-x0="18">18 m</button>
          <button type="button" data-x0="24">临界 24 m</button>
          <button type="button" data-x0="30">30 m</button>
        </div>
        <div class="intersection-row">
          D = 0 的交点：<strong id="rootCount">2</strong><span id="rootWord">次</span>
        </div>
        <div class="formula-mini" id="minNote">t = 4 s 时，D_min = x₀ − 24。</div>
        <button class="cond-btn" id="condBtn" type="button">归纳两次相遇的条件</button>
      </div>

      <div class="card side-card">
        <div class="side-title"><span>实时读数</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:#8192a8;">单位：m、s</span></div>
        <div class="readout-grid">
          <div class="metric"><span>时间 t</span><strong id="rTime">0.00 s</strong></div>
          <div class="metric"><span id="rVrelLabel">相对速度 vA−vB</span><strong id="rVrel">12.0 m/s</strong><small id="rVrelHint">S>0，间距=S</small></div>
          <div class="metric"><span>A 速度</span><strong id="rVA">16.0 m/s</strong></div>
          <div class="metric"><span>B 速度</span><strong id="rVB">4.0 m/s</strong></div>
          <div class="metric"><span>A 位置</span><strong id="rXA">56.0 m</strong></div>
          <div class="metric"><span>B 位置</span><strong id="rXB">0.0 m</strong></div>
          <div class="metric wide"><span>两车间距</span><strong id="rGap">56.0 m</strong><small id="rAhead">A 在前</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card side-card">
        <div class="side-title"><span>结论与关系</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:#8192a8;">随操作揭示</span></div>
        <div id="conclusions"></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

<script>
(function(){
  "use strict";

  const COLORS = {
    A: "#e05d43",
    B: "#2477c8",
    grid: "#edf3fa",
    axis: "#9fb0c7",
    muted: "#788ba3",
    zero: "#d45b6a",
    dark: "#284765"
  };

  const WORLD_MIN = -12;
  const WORLD_MAX = 168;
  const SCENE_LEFT = 55;
  const SCENE_WIDTH = 790;
  const A_LANE_Y = 207;
  const B_LANE_Y = 283;

  function initialRevealed(){
    return { max: false, stop: false, meet: false, cond: false };
  }

  const state = {
    mode: "case1",
    t: 0,
    x0: 18,
    playing: false,
    focus: "none",
    revealed: initialRevealed()
  };

  let rafId = null;
  let lastTs = 0;

  const dom = {
    modeCase1: document.getElementById("modeCase1"),
    modeCase3: document.getElementById("modeCase3"),
    sceneSvg: document.getElementById("sceneSvg"),
    sceneSubtitle: document.getElementById("sceneSubtitle"),
    sceneHint: document.getElementById("sceneHint"),
    staticTicks: document.getElementById("staticTicks"),
    bracketGroup: document.getElementById("bracketGroup"),
    carsGroup: document.getElementById("carsGroup"),
    arrowsGroup: document.getElementById("arrowsGroup"),
    overlayGroup: document.getElementById("overlayGroup"),
    vtSvg: document.getElementById("vtSvg"),
    gapSvg: document.getElementById("gapSvg"),
    gapFormulaLabel: document.getElementById("gapFormulaLabel"),
    timeSlider: document.getElementById("timeSlider"),
    tLabel: document.getElementById("tLabel"),
    playBtn: document.getElementById("playBtn"),
    playStateText: document.getElementById("playStateText"),
    resetBtn: document.getElementById("resetBtn"),
    case1Panel: document.getElementById("case1Panel"),
    case3Panel: document.getElementById("case3Panel"),
    stepNote: document.getElementById("stepNote"),
    x0Slider: document.getElementById("x0Slider"),
    x0Label: document.getElementById("x0Label"),
    rootCount: document.getElementById("rootCount"),
    rootWord: document.getElementById("rootWord"),
    minNote: document.getElementById("minNote"),
    condBtn: document.getElementById("condBtn"),
    rTime: document.getElementById("rTime"),
    rVrel: document.getElementById("rVrel"),
    rVrelLabel: document.getElementById("rVrelLabel"),
    rVrelHint: document.getElementById("rVrelHint"),
    rVA: document.getElementById("rVA"),
    rVB: document.getElementById("rVB"),
    rXA: document.getElementById("rXA"),
    rXB: document.getElementById("rXB"),
    rGap: document.getElementById("rGap"),
    rAhead: document.getElementById("rAhead"),
    conclusions: document.getElementById("conclusions")
  };

  function clamp(v, lo, hi){ return Math.min(hi, Math.max(lo, v)); }

  function fmt(v, d){
    const n = Number(v);
    if (!isFinite(n)) return "—";
    return n.toFixed(d === undefined ? 1 : d);
  }

  function X(worldX){
    return SCENE_LEFT + ((worldX - WORLD_MIN) / (WORLD_MAX - WORLD_MIN)) * SCENE_WIDTH;
  }

  function motion(t, mode, x0){
    const tt = Math.max(0, t);
    const vA = Math.max(0, 16 - 2 * tt);
    const vB = 4 + tt;
    let xA, xB;

    if (mode === "case1") {
      xA = tt <= 8 ? 56 + 16 * tt - tt * tt : 120;
      xB = 4 * tt + 0.5 * tt * tt;
    } else {
      xA = tt <= 8 ? 16 * tt - tt * tt : 64;
      xB = x0 + 4 * tt + 0.5 * tt * tt;
    }

    return {
      t: tt,
      vA: vA,
      vB: vB,
      xA: xA,
      xB: xB,
      gap: Math.abs(xA - xB),
      signed: mode === "case1" ? xA - xB : xB - xA
    };
  }

  function gapAt(t, mode, x0){
    if (mode === "case1") {
      const xA = t <= 8 ? 56 + 16 * t - t * t : 120;
      const xB = 4 * t + 0.5 * t * t;
      return xA - xB;
    } else {
      const xA = t <= 8 ? 16 * t - t * t : 64;
      const xB = x0 + 4 * t + 0.5 * t * t;
      return xB - xA;
    }
  }

  function rootInfo(x0){
    if (x0 < 24 - 1e-9) {
      const r = Math.sqrt(16 - (2 / 3) * x0);
      return { count: 2, roots: [4 - r, 4 + r] };
    }
    if (Math.abs(x0 - 24) < 1e-9) {
      return { count: 1, roots: [4] };
    }
    return { count: 0, roots: [] };
  }

  function niceStep(raw){
    if (!isFinite(raw) || raw <= 0) return 1;
    const pow = Math.pow(10, Math.floor(Math.log10(raw)));
    const n = raw / pow;
    let base;
    if (n <= 1) base = 1;
    else if (n <= 2) base = 2;
    else if (n <= 5) base = 5;
    else base = 10;
    return base * pow;
  }

  function labelNum(v, step){
    if (step >= 1) return String(Math.round(v));
    return v.toFixed(1);
  }

  function initTicks(){
    let html = "";
    for (let m = 0; m <= 160; m += 20) {
      const px = X(m);
      html += '<line x1="' + px.toFixed(1) + '" y1="321" x2="' + px.toFixed(1) + '" y2="330" stroke="#9fb1c6" stroke-width="1.2"></line>';
      html += '<text x="' + px.toFixed(1) + '" y="348" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#72859d">' + m + '</text>';
    }
    dom.staticTicks.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function carSVG(px, py, name, color){
    return '' +
      '<g transform="translate(' + px.toFixed(1) + ',' + py + ')" filter="url(#carShadow)">' +
        '<path d="M -18 -13 Q -12 -27 0 -27 Q 12 -27 18 -13 Z" fill="' + color + '" opacity="0.92"></path>' +
        '<rect x="-27" y="-13" width="54" height="26" rx="9" fill="' + color + '"></rect>' +
        '<rect x="-14" y="-8.5" width="10.5" height="7.5" rx="2.5" fill="#e3f2ff" opacity="0.9"></rect>' +
        '<rect x="2" y="-8.5" width="10.5" height="7.5" rx="2.5" fill="#e3f2ff" opacity="0.9"></rect>' +
        '<circle cx="-16" cy="14" r="5" fill="#28394e"></circle>' +
        '<circle cx="16" cy="14" r="5" fill="#28394e"></circle>' +
        '<text x="0" y="5" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="900" fill="#ffffff">' + name + '</text>' +
      '</g>';
  }

  function arrowSVG(px, arrowY, v, color, label){
    const baseX = px + 30;
    if (v < 0.04) {
      return '<text x="' + (baseX - 24).toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (arrowY - 6) + '" font-size="11.5" font-weight="800" fill="' + color + '">' + label + '=0</text>';
    }
    const len = Math.min(v * 3.35, 112);
    const tipX = baseX + len;
    return '' +
      '<g>' +
        '<line x1="' + baseX.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + arrowY + '" x2="' + tipX.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + arrowY + '" stroke="' + color + '" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"></line>' +
        '<polygon points="' + tipX.toFixed(1) + ',' + (arrowY - 6) + ' ' + (tipX + 10).toFixed(1) + ',' + arrowY + ' ' + tipX.toFixed(1) + ',' + (arrowY + 6) + '" fill="' + color + '"></polygon>' +
        '<text x="' + (baseX + len / 2).toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (arrowY - 8) + '" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="800" fill="' + color + '">' + label + '=' + fmt(v, 1) + '</text>' +
      '</g>';
  }

  function renderScene(s){
    const pxA = X(s.xA);
    const pxB = X(s.xB);

    dom.carsGroup.innerHTML =
      carSVG(pxA, A_LANE_Y, "A", COLORS.A) +
      carSVG(pxB, B_LANE_Y, "B", COLORS.B);

    dom.arrowsGroup.innerHTML =
      arrowSVG(pxA, 180, s.vA, COLORS.A, "vA") +
      arrowSVG(pxB, 256, s.vB, COLORS.B, "vB");

    const gap = s.gap;
    const lo = Math.min(pxA, pxB);
    const hi = Math.max(pxA, pxB);
    const mid = (pxA + pxB) / 2;
    let bracket = "";
    let overlay = "";

    if (gap < 0.16) {
      const bx = mid;
      bracket += '<line x1="' + bx.toFixed(1) + '" y1="94" x2="' + bx.toFixed(1) + '" y2="340" stroke="#d94c5d" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="7 7" opacity="0.82"></line>';
      bracket += '<rect x="' + (bx - 34).toFixed(1) + '" y="78" width="68" height="22" rx="11" fill="#fff2f3" stroke="#efb4bc"></rect>';
      bracket += '<text x="' + bx.toFixed(1) + '" y="93" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="900" fill="#bd394b">相遇</text>';
    } else {
      const labelW = 112;
      const labelX = clamp(mid - labelW / 2, 62, 838 - labelW);
      const ahead = s.xA > s.xB ? "A 在前" : "B 在前";

      bracket += '<line x1="' + lo.toFixed(1) + '" y1="126" x2="' + hi.toFixed(1) + '" y2="126" stroke="#617792" stroke-width="2"></line>';
      bracket += '<line x1="' + lo.toFixed(1) + '" y1="118" x2="' + lo.toFixed(1) + '" y2="134" stroke="#617792" stroke-width="2"></line>';
      bracket += '<line x1="' + hi.toFixed(1) + '" y1="118" x2="' + hi.toFixed(1) + '" y2="134" stroke="#617792" stroke-width="2"></line>';
      bracket += '<line x1="' + lo.toFixed(1) + '" y1="134" x2="' + lo.toFixed(1) + '" y2="160" stroke="#c7d3e1" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 4"></line>';
      bracket += '<line x1="' + hi.toFixed(1) + '" y1="134" x2="' + hi.toFixed(1) + '" y2="160" stroke="#c7d3e1" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 4"></line>';
      bracket += '<rect x="' + labelX.toFixed(1) + '" y="100" width="' + labelW + '" height="25" rx="12.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#d8e3ef"></rect>';
      bracket += '<text x="' + (labelX + labelW / 2).toFixed(1) + '" y="117" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.2" font-weight="900" fill="#3f5878">间距 ' + fmt(gap, 1) + ' m</text>';
      bracket += '<text x="' + mid.toFixed(1) + '" y="151" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700" fill="#7a8da5">' + ahead + '</text>';
    }

    if (s.vA < 0.04) {
      overlay += '<g transform="translate(' + pxA.toFixed(1) + ',239)">' +
        '<rect x="-38" y="-10" width="76" height="20" rx="10" fill="#fff6f3" stroke="#f0bbb0"></rect>' +
        '<text x="0" y="4" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#b44731">A 已停下</text>' +
      '</g>';
    }

    dom.bracketGroup.innerHTML = bracket;
    dom.overlayGroup.innerHTML = overlay;
  }

  function renderVT(s){
    const W = 460, H = 245, L = 44, R = 16, T = 25, B = 34;
    const tmax = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
    const ymax = 22;
    const xp = function(t){ return L + (t / tmax) * (W - L - R); };
    const yp = function(v){ return T + (ymax - v) / ymax * (H - T - B); };

    let g = '<rect x="0" y="0" width="460" height="245" rx="10" fill="#ffffff"></rect>';

    for (let t = 0; t <= tmax + 1e-9; t += 2) {
      const x = xp(t);
      g += '<line x1="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.grid + '" stroke-width="1"></line>';
      g += '<text x="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (H - 12) + '" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#7d8da3">' + t + '</text>';
    }
    for (let v = 0; v <= 20; v += 4) {
      const y = yp(v);
      g += '<line x1="' + L + '" y1="' + y.toFixed(1) + '" x2="' + (W - R) + '" y2="' + y.toFixed(1) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.grid + '" stroke-width="1"></line>';
      g += '<text x="' + (L - 6) + '" y="' + (y + 3.5).toFixed(1) + '" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#7d8da3">' + v + '</text>';
    }

    g += '<line x1="' + L + '" y1="' + (H - B) + '" x2="' + (W - R) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.axis + '" stroke-width="1.2"></line>';
    g += '<line x1="' + L + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + L + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.axis + '" stroke-width="1.2"></line>';
    g += '<text x="' + (W - R) + '" y="' + (H - 12) + '" text-anchor="end" font-size="10.5" fill="#70839b">t / s</text>';
    g += '<text x="' + (L + 4) + '" y="14" font-size="10.5" fill="#70839b">v / (m·s⁻¹)</text>';

    let ptsA = [];
    let ptsB = [];
    const steps = 240;
    for (let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {
      const t = tmax * i / steps;
      const vA = Math.max(0, 16 - 2 * t);
      const vB = 4 + t;
      ptsA.push(xp(t).toFixed(1) + "," + yp(vA).toFixed(1));
      ptsB.push(xp(t).toFixed(1) + "," + yp(vB).toFixed(1));
    }

    g += '<polyline points="' + ptsA.join(" ") + '" fill="none" stroke="' + COLORS.A + '" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>';
    g += '<polyline points="' + ptsB.join(" ") + '" fill="none" stroke="' + COLORS.B + '" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>';

    if (state.mode === "case3" || state.revealed.max || state.focus === "max" || state.focus === "min" || state.revealed.cond) {
      const x4 = xp(4);
      const y8 = yp(8);
      g += '<line x1="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="#2b5f9e" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 4" opacity="0.7"></line>';
      g += '<circle cx="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" cy="' + y8.toFixed(1) + '" r="5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#2b5f9e" stroke-width="2.2"></circle>';
      g += '<text x="' + (x4 + 6).toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (y8 - 8).toFixed(1) + '" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#245b97">vA = vB</text>';
      g += '<text x="' + (x4 + 6).toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (y8 + 10).toFixed(1) + '" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700" fill="#5f7897">间距变化率 = 0</text>';
    }

    if (state.mode === "case1" || state.mode === "case3") {
      const x8 = xp(8);
      g += '<line x1="' + x8.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + x8.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="' + (state.revealed.stop ? "#b45647" : "#c4cfdd") + '" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4 5"></line>';
      g += '<text x="' + (x8 + 4).toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (H - B - 5) + '" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700" fill="' + (state.revealed.stop ? "#a94d3f" : "#96a6b9") + '">A停</text>';
    }

    const cx = xp(s.t);
    g += '<line x1="' + cx.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + cx.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="#203a5c" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity="0.58"></line>';
    g += '<circle cx="' + cx.toFixed(1) + '" cy="' + yp(s.vA).toFixed(1) + '" r="4.7" fill="' + COLORS.A + '" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.7"></circle>';
    g += '<circle cx="' + cx.toFixed(1) + '" cy="' + yp(s.vB).toFixed(1) + '" r="4.7" fill="' + COLORS.B + '" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.7"></circle>';

    g += '<line x1="' + (W - 135) + '" y1="14" x2="' + (W - 115) + '" y2="14" stroke="' + COLORS.A + '" stroke-width="3"></line>';
    g += '<text x="' + (W - 109) + '" y="17.5" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#5d6f86">A</text>';
    g += '<line x1="' + (W - 78) + '" y1="14" x2="' + (W - 58) + '" y2="14" stroke="' + COLORS.B + '" stroke-width="3"></line>';
    g += '<text x="' + (W - 52) + '" y="17.5" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#5d6f86">B</text>';

    dom.vtSvg.innerHTML = g;
  }

  function renderGap(s){
    const W = 460, H = 245, L = 48, R = 16, T = 22, B = 34;
    const tmax = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;

    const vals = [];
    for (let i = 0; i <= 240; i++) {
      const t = tmax * i / 240;
      vals.push(gapAt(t, state.mode, state.x0));
    }

    let mn = Math.min.apply(null, vals);
    let mx = Math.max.apply(null, vals);
    let pad = Math.max(4, (mx - mn) * 0.16);
    let rawMin = Math.min(0, mn - pad);
    let rawMax = Math.max(0, mx + pad);
    if (rawMax - rawMin < 8) {
      rawMin -= 4;
      rawMax += 4;
    }
    const step = niceStep((rawMax - rawMin) / 4);
    const ymin = Math.floor(rawMin / step) * step;
    const ymax = Math.ceil(rawMax / step) * step;

    const xp = function(t){ return L + (t / tmax) * (W - L - R); };
    const yp = function(v){ return T + (ymax - v) / (ymax - ymin) * (H - T - B); };

    let g = '<rect x="0" y="0" width="460" height="245" rx="10" fill="#ffffff"></rect>';

    for (let t = 0; t <= tmax + 1e-9; t += 2) {
      const x = xp(t);
      g += '<line x1="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.grid + '" stroke-width="1"></line>';
      g += '<text x="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (H - 12) + '" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#7d8da3">' + t + '</text>';
    }

    const vCount = Math.min(20, Math.round((ymax - ymin) / step));
    for (let i = 0; i <= vCount; i++) {
      const v = ymin + i * step;
      const y = yp(v);
      g += '<line x1="' + L + '" y1="' + y.toFixed(1) + '" x2="' + (W - R) + '" y2="' + y.toFixed(1) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.grid + '" stroke-width="1"></line>';
      g += '<text x="' + (L - 6) + '" y="' + (y + 3.5).toFixed(1) + '" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill="#7d8da3">' + labelNum(v, step) + '</text>';
    }

    g += '<line x1="' + L + '" y1="' + (H - B) + '" x2="' + (W - R) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.axis + '" stroke-width="1.2"></line>';
    g += '<line x1="' + L + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + L + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.axis + '" stroke-width="1.2"></line>';
    g += '<text x="' + (W - R) + '" y="' + (H - 12) + '" text-anchor="end" font-size="10.5" fill="#70839b">t / s</text>';

    const y0 = yp(0);
    g += '<line x1="' + L + '" y1="' + y0.toFixed(1) + '" x2="' + (W - R) + '" y2="' + y0.toFixed(1) + '" stroke="' + COLORS.zero + '" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.58"></line>';
    g += '<text x="' + (W - R) + '" y="' + (y0 - 5).toFixed(1) + '" text-anchor="end" font-size="9.5" fill="#c45767">0 轴：相遇</text>';

    let pts = [];
    for (let i = 0; i <= 240; i++) {
      const t = tmax * i / 240;
      const v = gapAt(t, state.mode, state.x0);
      pts.push(xp(t).toFixed(1) + "," + yp(v).toFixed(1));
    }
    const lineColor = state.mode === "case1" ? "#355d8f" : "#4b6f97";
    g += '<polyline points="' + pts.join(" ") + '" fill="none" stroke="' + lineColor + '" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></polyline>';

    let roots = [];
    if (state.mode === "case1") {
      if (state.revealed.meet) roots = [12];
    } else {
      roots = rootInfo(state.x0).roots;
    }

    roots.forEach(function(rt, idx){
      if (rt >= 0 && rt <= tmax) {
        const x = xp(rt);
        g += '<line x1="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="#df5b68" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity="0.55"></line>';
        g += '<circle cx="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" cy="' + y0.toFixed(1) + '" r="4.6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#df5b68" stroke-width="2.2"></circle>';
        if (state.mode === "case3" || state.revealed.meet) {
          g += '<text x="' + x.toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (H - B + 16) + '" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#b64858">t' + (idx + 1) + '</text>';
        }
      }
    });

    if (state.mode === "case1" && state.revealed.max) {
      const x4 = xp(4);
      const yv = yp(gapAt(4, "case1", state.x0));
      g += '<line x1="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + yv.toFixed(1) + '" x2="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + y0.toFixed(1) + '" stroke="#e09139" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 4"></line>';
      g += '<circle cx="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" cy="' + yv.toFixed(1) + '" r="5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e09139" stroke-width="2.2"></circle>';
      g += '<text x="' + (x4 + 6).toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (yv - 7).toFixed(1) + '" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#b87522">最大 80 m（vA=vB）</text>';
    }

    if (state.mode === "case3" && (state.focus === "min" || state.revealed.cond)) {
      const x4 = xp(4);
      const minV = state.x0 - 24;
      const yv = yp(minV);
      g += '<line x1="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + yv.toFixed(1) + '" x2="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + y0.toFixed(1) + '" stroke="#d78a2e" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity="0.8"></line>';
      g += '<circle cx="' + x4.toFixed(1) + '" cy="' + yv.toFixed(1) + '" r="5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#d78a2e" stroke-width="2.2"></circle>';
      g += '<text x="' + (x4 + 6).toFixed(1) + '" y="' + (yv - 7).toFixed(1) + '" font-size="10.5" font-weight="800" fill="#a76b1e">D_min = ' + fmt(minV, 1) + ' m</text>';
    }

    const cx = xp(s.t);
    const cy = yp(gapAt(s.t, state.mode, state.x0));
    g += '<line x1="' + cx.toFixed(1) + '" y1="' + T + '" x2="' + cx.toFixed(1) + '" y2="' + (H - B) + '" stroke="#203a5c" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="3 4" opacity="0.58"></line>';
    g += '<circle cx="' + cx.toFixed(1) + '" cy="' + cy.toFixed(1) + '" r="4.8" fill="' + (state.mode === "case1" ? "#355d8f" : "#4b6f97") + '" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8"></circle>';

    const metricText = state.mode === "case1" ? "S = xA − xB" : "D = xB − xA";
    const axisNote = state.mode === "case1" ? "纵轴 S / m；间距 = |S|" : "纵轴 D / m；间距 = |D|";
    g += '<text x="' + (L + 5) + '" y="14" font-size="10.5" font-weight="700" fill="#72859d">' + metricText + '</text>';
    g += '<text x="' + (W - R) + '" y="14" text-anchor="end" font-size="9.5" font-weight="700" fill="#72859d">' + axisNote + '</text>';

    dom.gapSvg.innerHTML = g;
    dom.gapFormulaLabel.textContent = metricText + "（间距 = |" + (state.mode === "case1" ? "S" : "D") + "|）";
  }

  function getStatus(s){
    const EPS = 0.02;
    if (state.mode === "case1") {
      const t = s.t;
      if (t < 0.02) return ["初态", "A 在前、B 在后，相距 56.0 m；A 相对 B 更快，间距先增大。"];
      if (t < 3.98) return ["运动中", "vA > vB，间距继续增大；当前间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      if (Math.abs(t - 4) <= EPS) return ["峰值", "vA = vB = 8 m/s；相对速度为 0，间距达到最大 80 m。"];
      if (t < 7.98) return ["运动中", "vA < vB，间距开始缩小；当前间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      if (Math.abs(t - 8) <= EPS) return ["关键点", "t = 8 s：A 停下（x=120 m），B 在 64 m，两车相距 56.0 m。"];
      if (t < 11.98) {
        if (s.gap < 6) return ["接近相遇", "B 正在追上 A；实时间距仅 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
        return ["追赶", "A 静止，B 继续加速追赶；当前间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      }
      if (Math.abs(t - 12) <= EPS) return ["相遇", "t = 12 s 时，B 追上 A；两车位置同为 120 m，间距 0 m。"];
      return ["已相遇", "B 已在 A 前，间距重新增大；实时间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
    }

    const info = rootInfo(state.x0);
    const t = s.t;
    const x0 = state.x0;
    if (x0 < 24 - 1e-9) {
      const t1 = info.roots[0];
      const t2 = info.roots[1];
      if (t < t1 - EPS) return ["追近", "A 在后且更快（vA>vB），间距缩小；实时间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      if (Math.abs(t - t1) <= EPS) return ["第一次相遇", "t ≈ " + fmt(t1, 1) + " s，A 追上 B；此后 A 在前，D<0。"];
      if (t < 4 - EPS) return ["A 在前，间距增大", "第一次相遇后 vA 仍大于 vB，A 继续拉开；间距 = |D| = " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      if (Math.abs(t - 4) <= EPS) return ["间距转折", "t = 4 s：vA = vB，A 不再拉开；D_min = x₀−24 = " + fmt(x0 - 24, 1) + " m，|D| = " + fmt(Math.abs(x0 - 24), 1) + " m。"];
      if (t < t2 - EPS) return ["B 开始追近", "t > 4 s 后 vB > vA，B 逐渐追近；D 仍小于 0，间距 = |D| = " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      if (Math.abs(t - t2) <= EPS) return ["第二次相遇", "t ≈ " + fmt(t2, 1) + " s，B 再次追上 A；D = 0。"];
      return ["B 在前", "第二次相遇后 B 更快且在前，间距重新增大；实时间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
    } else if (Math.abs(x0 - 24) < 1e-9) {
      if (t < 4 - EPS) return ["追近", "A 从后追近 B；实时间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      if (Math.abs(t - 4) <= EPS) return ["临界", "t = 4 s，两车恰好接触一次（D_min = 0），没有穿过彼此。"];
      return ["远离", "B 加速后在前，间距增大，不再相遇。"];
    } else {
      if (t < 4 - EPS) return ["追近", "A 追近 B；实时间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
      if (Math.abs(t - 4) <= EPS) return ["未追上", "t = 4 s 时，间距最小：x₀−24 = " + fmt(x0 - 24, 1) + " m > 0，仍未追上。"];
      return ["远离", "B 更快且在前，两车间距增大；实时间距 " + fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m。"];
    }
  }

  function updateStatus(s){
    const info = getStatus(s);
    dom.sceneHint.innerHTML = '<span class="hint-tag">' + info[0] + '</span><span>' + info[1] + '</span>';
  }

  function updateReadouts(s){
    dom.rTime.textContent = fmt(s.t, 2) + " s";
    if (state.mode === "case1") {
      dom.rVrelLabel.textContent = "相对速度 vA−vB";
      dom.rVrel.textContent = fmt(s.vA - s.vB, 1) + " m/s";
      dom.rVrelHint.textContent = "S = xA−xB，间距 = |S|";
    } else {
      dom.rVrelLabel.textContent = "D 的变化率 vB−vA";
      dom.rVrel.textContent = fmt(s.vB - s.vA, 1) + " m/s";
      dom.rVrelHint.textContent = "D = xB−xA；间距 = |D|" + (s.signed < -0.01 ? "，D<0：A 在前" : (s.signed > 0.01 ? "，D>0：B 在前" : "，D=0"));
    }
    dom.rVA.textContent = fmt(s.vA, 1) + " m/s";
    dom.rVB.textContent = fmt(s.vB, 1) + " m/s";
    dom.rXA.textContent = fmt(s.xA, 1) + " m";
    dom.rXB.textContent = fmt(s.xB, 1) + " m";
    dom.rGap.textContent = fmt(s.gap, 1) + " m";
    dom.rAhead.textContent = s.gap < 0.02 ? "两车相遇" : (s.xA > s.xB ? "A 在前" : "B 在前");
  }

  function updateTimeUI(s){
    const maxT = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
    dom.timeSlider.max = maxT;
    if (Math.abs(parseFloat(dom.timeSlider.value) - s.t) > 0.002) {
      dom.timeSlider.value = s.t.toFixed(2);
    }
    dom.tLabel.textContent = fmt(s.t, 2);
    dom.playBtn.textContent = state.playing ? "暂停" : "播放";
    dom.playStateText.textContent = state.playing ? "播放中" : "暂停";
  }

  function updateStepButtons(){
    document.querySelectorAll(".step-btn").forEach(function(btn){
      btn.classList.toggle("active", btn.dataset.step === state.focus);
    });
    dom.condBtn.classList.toggle("active", state.revealed.cond);
  }

  function updateStepNote(){
    if (state.mode !== "case1") return;
    const map = {
      start: "初态：A 在 56 m 处，B 在 0 m 处；A 更快，间距先增大。",
      max: "同一时刻看两图：先 vA>vB，间距增大；后 vA<vB，间距减小；故 vA=vB（t=4 s）时间距最大。",
      stop: "A 速度减到 0，位置停在 120 m；B 仍以 12 m/s 继续追。",
      meet: "B 追上 A，间距变为 0。"
    };
    dom.stepNote.textContent = map[state.focus] || "拖动时间，观察两车与两张图的同步变化。";
  }

  function updateExploration(){
    if (state.mode !== "case3") return;
    const info = rootInfo(state.x0);
    dom.x0Label.textContent = fmt(state.x0, 1);
    if (Math.abs(parseFloat(dom.x0Slider.value) - state.x0) > 1e-9) {
      dom.x0Slider.value = state.x0;
    }
    dom.rootCount.textContent = String(info.count);
    dom.rootWord.textContent = info.count === 2 ? " 次（可相遇两次）" : (info.count === 1 ? " 次（临界，只接触一次）" : " 次（不相遇）");
    dom.rootCount.classList.remove("count-good", "count-one", "count-zero");
    if (info.count === 2) dom.rootCount.classList.add("count-good");
    else if (info.count === 1) dom.rootCount.classList.add("count-one");
    else dom.rootCount.classList.add("count-zero");
    dom.minNote.innerHTML = '合并：D = xB − xA = (x₀ + 4t + ½t²) − (16t − t²) = x₀ − 12t + 1.5t²。<br>在 vA = vB（t = 4 s）时取极值：D_min = x₀ − 24 = ' + fmt(state.x0, 1) + ' − 24 = <strong>' + fmt(state.x0 - 24, 1) + ' m</strong>；间距 = |D_min| = <strong>' + fmt(Math.abs(state.x0 - 24), 1) + ' m</strong>。';
  }

  function updateConclusions(s){
    if (state.mode === "case1") {
      let html = "";
      html += '<div class="result-row">' +
        '<div class="result-label">（1）两车何时相距最大？最大多少？</div>' +
        '<div class="result-value ' + (state.revealed.max ? "" : "pending") + '">' +
          (state.revealed.max ? "t = 4 s，最大间距 80 m" : "点击“找最大间距”后揭示") +
        '</div>' +
        (state.revealed.max ? '<div class="formula-mini">两图在同一 t 的竖线对应：S 的变化率 = vA − vB。t &lt; 4 s 时 vA &gt; vB，S 增大；t &gt; 4 s 时 vA &lt; vB，S 减小，所以 vA = vB 时取极大。<br>vA = vB → 16 − 2t = 4 + t → t = 4 s<br>S = 56 + 12t − 1.5t² → t = 4 s 时 S = 80 m</div>' : '') +
      '</div>';

      if (state.revealed.stop) {
        html += '<div class="result-row">' +
          '<div class="result-label">关键转折：A 停下</div>' +
          '<div class="result-value" style="font-size:13px;">t = 8 s，A 停在 120 m；B 在 64 m，还差 56 m。</div>' +
        '</div>';
      }

      html += '<div class="result-row">' +
        '<div class="result-label">（2）经过多长时间两车相遇？</div>' +
        '<div class="result-value ' + (state.revealed.meet ? "" : "pending") + '">' +
          (state.revealed.meet ? "t = 12 s" : "点击“求相遇时间”后揭示") +
        '</div>' +
        (state.revealed.meet ? '<div class="formula-mini">以初始时刻为 t = 0：B 的位移 xB = 4t + ½t²，A 停在 120 m。<br>令 120 = 4t + ½t² → t² + 8t − 240 = 0 → t = 12 s。<br>也可令 τ = t − 8：56 = 12τ + ½τ² → τ = 4 s，故 t = 8 + 4 = 12 s。</div>' : '') +
      '</div>';

      dom.conclusions.innerHTML = html;
      return;
    }

    const info = rootInfo(state.x0);
    const countText = info.count === 2 ? "两次相遇" : (info.count === 1 ? "一次接触（临界）" : "不相遇");
    let html = "";
    html += '<div class="result-row">' +
      '<div class="result-label">当前 x₀ = ' + fmt(state.x0, 1) + ' m 时</div>' +
      '<div class="result-value">' + countText + '</div>' +
    '</div>';

    html += '<div class="result-row">' +
      '<div class="result-label">（3）两车可以相遇两次的条件</div>' +
      '<div class="result-value ' + (state.revealed.cond ? "" : "pending") + '">' +
        (state.revealed.cond ? "0 < x₀ < 24 m" : "拖动 x₀ 观察交点，再点“归纳条件”") +
      '</div>' +
      (state.revealed.cond ? '<div class="formula-mini">先合并位置：A 的位移 xA = 16t − t²（t≤8 s；之后停在 64 m），B 的位置 xB = x₀ + 4t + ½t²。<br>取 D = xB − xA = x₀ − 12t + 1.5t²，两车间距 = |D|。<br>t = 4 s 时 D 取最小值 D_min = x₀ − 24。<br>要相遇两次：D 必须穿过 0（D_min < 0），且初始 x₀ > 0。<br>所以：0 < x₀ < 24 m。</div>' : '') +
    '</div>';

    dom.conclusions.innerHTML = html;
  }

  function render(){
    const maxT = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
    if (state.t > maxT) state.t = maxT;
    const s = motion(state.t, state.mode, state.x0);
    updateTimeUI(s);
    renderScene(s);
    renderVT(s);
    renderGap(s);
    updateReadouts(s);
    updateStatus(s);
    updateStepButtons();
    updateStepNote();
    updateExploration();
    updateConclusions(s);
  }

  function stopAnimation(){
    state.playing = false;
    if (rafId !== null) {
      cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);
      rafId = null;
    }
    lastTs = 0;
  }

  function playLoop(ts){
    if (!state.playing) return;
    if (!lastTs) lastTs = ts;
    const dt = Math.min(0.06, (ts - lastTs) / 1000);
    lastTs = ts;
    const maxT = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
    state.t = Math.min(maxT, state.t + dt);
    if (state.t >= maxT - 1e-7) {
      state.t = maxT;
      state.playing = false;
    }
    render();
    if (state.playing) {
      rafId = requestAnimationFrame(playLoop);
    }
  }

  function togglePlay(){
    if (state.playing) {
      stopAnimation();
      render();
      return;
    }
    const maxT = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
    if (state.t >= maxT - 1e-6) state.t = 0;
    state.playing = true;
    lastTs = 0;
    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(playLoop);
    render();
  }

  function setMode(mode){
    state.mode = mode;
    state.t = 0;
    state.focus = "none";
    stopAnimation();
    state.revealed = initialRevealed();
    if (dom.sceneSubtitle) {
      dom.sceneSubtitle.textContent = mode === "case1"
        ? "同向直公路：A 在前、B 在后，相距 56 m；A 减速，B 加速。"
        : "同向直公路：A 在后、B 在前，初始间距 x₀ 可调；A 减速，B 加速。";
    }
    dom.modeCase1.classList.toggle("active", mode === "case1");
    dom.modeCase3.classList.toggle("active", mode === "case3");
    dom.case1Panel.classList.toggle("hidden", mode !== "case1");
    dom.case3Panel.classList.toggle("hidden", mode !== "case3");
    dom.timeSlider.max = mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
    dom.timeSlider.value = 0;
    render();
  }

  function bindEvents(){
    dom.modeCase1.addEventListener("click", function(){ setMode("case1"); });
    dom.modeCase3.addEventListener("click", function(){ setMode("case3"); });

    dom.playBtn.addEventListener("click", togglePlay);

    dom.timeSlider.addEventListener("input", function(){
      stopAnimation();
      const maxT = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
      state.t = clamp(parseFloat(dom.timeSlider.value), 0, maxT);
      state.focus = "free";
      render();
    });

    document.querySelectorAll("[data-dt]").forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener("click", function(){
        stopAnimation();
        const maxT = state.mode === "case1" ? 14 : 10;
        state.t = clamp(state.t + parseFloat(btn.dataset.dt), 0, maxT);
        state.focus = "free";
        render();
      });
    });

    dom.resetBtn.addEventListener("click", function(){
      stopAnimation();
      state.t = 0;
      state.focus = "none";
      state.revealed = initialRevealed();
      render();
    });

    document.querySelectorAll(".step-btn").forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener("click", function(){
        stopAnimation();
        const step = btn.dataset.step;
        state.focus = step;
        if (step === "start") {
          state.t = 0;
          state.revealed = initialRevealed();
        }
        if (step === "max") {
          state.t = 4;
          state.revealed.max = true;
        }
        if (step === "stop") {
          state.t = 8;
          state.revealed.stop = true;
        }
        if (step === "meet") {
          state.t = 12;
          state.revealed.stop = true;
          state.revealed.meet = true;
        }
        if (step === "min") {
          state.t = 4;
        }
        render();
      });
    });

    dom.x0Slider.addEventListener("input", function(){
      stopAnimation();
      state.x0 = parseFloat(dom.x0Slider.value);
      state.focus = "free";
      render();
    });

    document.querySelectorAll("[data-x0]").forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener("click", function(){
        stopAnimation();
        state.x0 = parseFloat(btn.dataset.x0);
        state.t = 4;
        state.focus = "min";
        render();
      });
    });

    dom.condBtn.addEventListener("click", function(){
      stopAnimation();
      state.revealed.cond = true;
      state.focus = "cond";
      state.t = 4;
      render();
    });
  }

  initTicks();
  bindEvents();
  dom.case1Panel.classList.remove("hidden");
  dom.case3Panel.classList.add("hidden");
  render();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
